using StateSystem

~ guard_greet
Security Guard: Long shift tonight?
- 「是啊。你呢？」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1})
	=> guard_chat
- （沉默地走出去）
	=> END
- 「又是你值班？」 [if StateSystem.has_flag("guard_chatted")]
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1})
	=> guard_greet_variant

~ guard_greet_variant
Security Guard: Back again?\nSame rain, same shift.
- 「聊聊？」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1})
	=> guard_chat
- 「走了。」
	=> END

~ guard_chat
Security Guard: Same old. Night shift's quiet tonight.\nJust the rain and the monitors.
- 「早点休息。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1})
	do StateSystem.set_flag("guard_chatted", true)
	=> END
- 「这雨什么时候停。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1})
	=> guard_weather
- 「为什么上夜班？」 [if StateSystem.hope_despair >= 0]
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1})
	=> guard_deep_chat

~ guard_deep_chat
Security Guard: My kid asked why I work nights.\nI said: someone watches the city.\nSomeone keeps the lights on.
- 「说得好。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 2, "conviction": 0.5})
	do StateSystem.set_flag("guard_chatted", true)
	=> END

~ guard_weather
Security Guard: Forecast says it won't.\nBut forecasts lie.\nJust like the job description.
- 「哈哈…那我走了。」
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 1})
	do StateSystem.set_flag("guard_chatted", true)
	=> END
- 「谢谢。我走了。」 [if StateSystem.hope_despair >= 0]
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 2})
	do StateSystem.set_flag("guard_chatted", true)
	=> END
- 「…好吧。」 [if StateSystem.hope_despair < 0]
	do StateSystem.set_flag("guard_chatted", true)
	=> END
